3 column could measure as zero and reintroduce the same problem.\n\n","thinkingSignature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1oYWlrdS01LjUtMjAyNjEwMDd8Y2xhdWRlLW9uLWF3cyJ9"},{"type":"text","text":"I found the collapse. In `t6` at width 20, the fixed 30-wide column forces the table over budget. The \"last resort\" in `_calculate_column_widths` then reduces every column evenly, including the flexible column, which drops to 0. Before changing anything I need to see how `_measure_column` turns a width into a column width."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01KWD2nBSXFnfUxAd9LDJnEj","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /app && grep -n \"def _measure_column\" -A 40 rich/table.py; grep -n \"def flexible\" -B2 -A5 rich/table.py; grep -n \"def _get_padding_width\" -A 12 rich/table.py"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"openrouter","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5","usage":{"input":2,"output":3627,"cacheRead":12967,"cacheWrite":629,"totalTokens":17225,"cost":{"input":2.0000000000000002e-7,"output":0.0018135,"cacheRead":0.00012967,"cacheWrite":0.000078625,"total":0.002021995,"totalFromProvider":true},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":3398},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794165831777,"providerThinkingLevel":"medium","responseId":"msg_011Cgr1NYKn4HeziokmRTZWR","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":17906,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
